			"public": "<p><strong>Gadget</strong> &middot; <em>Engineer invention powered by Toolbelt scraps. Activate for 1 scrap; spend a 2nd scrap for the Toolbelt effect. Only Engineers gain the active benefit &mdash; an ally given this gadget gains only the Passive.</em></p><hr><p><strong>1 Action (1 scrap):</strong> Gain +1 to a stat of your choice for 2 turns.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt (2 scraps):</strong> Lasts 1 minute; you are Stunned for 1 turn after the effect ends.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> Temp HP you receive increases by 1.</p>",
